on Him].","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":159,"sd":null},{"k":"3:160","t":"If Allāh should aid you, no one can overcome you; but if He should forsake you, who is there that can aid you after Him? And upon Allāh let the believers rely.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":160,"sd":null},{"k":"3:161","t":"It is not [attributable] to any prophet that he would act unfaithfully [in regard to war booty]. And whoever betrays, [taking unlawfully], will come with what he took on the Day of Resurrection. Then will every soul be [fully] compensated for what it earned, and they will not be wronged.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":161,"sd":null},{"k":"3:162","t":"So is one who pursues the pleasure of Allāh like one who brings upon himself the anger of Allāh and whose refuge is Hell? And wretched is the destination.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":162,"sd":null},{"k":"3:163","t":"They are [varying] degrees in the sight of Allāh, and Allāh is Seeing of whatever they do.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":163,"sd":null},{"k":"3:164","t":"Certainly did Allāh confer [great] favor upon the believers when He sent among them a Messenger from themselves, reciting to them His verses and purifying them and teaching them the Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] and wisdom, although they had been before in manifest error.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":164,"sd":null},{"k":"3:165","t":"Why [is it that] when a [single] disaster struck you [on the day of Uḥud], although you had struck [the enemy in the battle of Badr] with one twice as great, you said, \"From where is this?\" Say, \"It is from yourselves [i.e., due to your sin].\" Indeed, Allāh is over all things competent.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":165,"sd":null}],"juz":4,"hizb":7,"surahs":[3],"sajdah":false}